          "claim": "For each $y\\in Y_x$, the Gibbs formula and positivity of $q_x(y)$ and $p_x^*(y)$ give $r_x(y)=\\beta\\log(p_x^*(y)/q_x(y))+\\beta\\log Z_x$.",
